(Precision farming in Sri Lanka faces distinctive micro-climatic challenges.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 647 Tm
(This paper reports on our experimental solar-assisted unmanned rovers designed) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 625 Tm
(to monitor paddy fields in Monaragala and Polonnaruwa.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 603 Tm
(Using lightweight multispectral sensors and computer vision algorithms, the rover) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 581 Tm
(detects fungal blight 72 hours before visible leaf discoloration occurs.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 559 Tm
(Field trials demonstrated a 34 percent reduction in chemical pesticide usage.) Tj
